        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(\"Berry\"), a global manufacturer of rigid and flexible packaging products, pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger (the \"Merger Agreement\") between Amcor, Aurora Spirit, Inc., a Delaware corporation and wholly-owned subsidiary of the Company, and Berry dated, November 19, 2024.",
