        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At Amcor, we are committed to attracting, developing, and retaining top talent as a key enabler of our business strategy.",
        "start_character": 20931,
        "end_character": 21052
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Sustainability is comprehensively embedded across our business, from the investments we are making in packaging innovation and design, to the work we undertake within our own operations and with our upstream and downstream partners to develop a more responsible packaging value chain.",
        "start_character": 6471,
        "end_character": 6755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The major markets in which we sell our products historically have been, and continue to be, highly competitive.",
        "start_character": 12784,
        "end_character": 12895
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are the owner or licensee of more than 5,000 United States and other country patents and patent applications that relate to our products, manufacturing processes, and equipment.",
        "start_character": 15093,
        "end_character": 15273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we are uniquely positioned to offer a variety of multi format packaging solutions with a wide, differentiated portfolio of products.",
        "start_character": 5785,
        "end_character": 5928
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We solve packaging challenges by developing differentiated products, services, and processes to protect our customers' products and fulfill the needs of the consumers who rely on them.",
        "start_character": 8946,
        "end_character": 9130
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For more than a decade, our EnviroAction program has helped us significantly improve how we manage energy, greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions, water, and waste in our manufacturing locations.",
        "start_character": 10571,
        "end_character": 10758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In January 2018, we became the world’s first packaging company to pledge that all our packaging would be designed to be recyclable, compostable, or reusable by 2025, and also committed to increasing the amount of recycled materials we use.",
        "start_character": 7920,
        "end_character": 8159
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001748790-25-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001748790-25-000023-3d73f73a18ee98f3",
        "accession_number": "0001748790-25-000023",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Innovation is central to Amcor’s approach to sustainability and we expect to spend approximately $180 million a year on research and development (\"R&D\") after the Merger, not including ongoing investments in continuous improvements.",
        "start_character": 8421,
        "end_character": 8653
      },
      {
